  m_text: '<style=h1><align=center>How to crack a password?</align></style>

    <indent=20px>1.
    Find Compressed Password in user''s system (Mix of 8 random capital letters)

    2.
    Copy or write down Compressed Password

    3. Open PCS (Password Cracking Software)

    4.
    Paste password using "Paste" button or CTRL + V, you can also type it in. Password
    will decompress automatically

    5. Decode Decompressed Password using Decoding
    Methods

    6. Match numbers or letters with correct method

    7. It might
    take a few decoding steps to get a password, PCS will tell you when it''s done</indent>


    For
    more information on how to recognize which methods should you use, press magnifying
    glass button to see details about chosen method.'
