  m_text: "<style=h1><align=center>Decimal Decoding</align></style>\n<indent=20px>1.
    Always contains two numbers from 0 to 9\n2. Ranges are:\n\t48 to 57 = 0 to 9\n\t65
    to 90 = A to Z</indent>\n<style=h1><align=center>Hexadecimal Decoding</align></style>\n<indent=20px>1.
    Contains numbers (0-9) and letters (A-F), for example 41 = A, 4A = J\n2. Ranges
    are:\n\t30 to 39 = 0 to 9\n\t41 to 49 = A to I\n\t4A to 4F = J to O\n\t50 to
    59 = P to Y\n\t5A = Z</indent>"
